  How Is Laisi and Leidos connected
  Thoughts >
  LAISI (often stylized as LASAI Aviation LLC) is
  the aviation division of Leidos, a major U.S.-
  based defense, aviation, and technology
  contractor. Leidos, headquartered in Reston,
  Virginia, provides services in areas like national
  security, health, and civil sectors, including
  extensive work with federal agencies such as
  the Federal Aviation Administration (FAA) and
  the Department of Defense.
  Key Connections:
  • Ownership and Structure: LAISI operates
  as a subsidiary or specialized arm of Leidos,
  focusing on aviation-related operations.
  This includes managing flight services,
  aircraft operations, and support for
  government contracts. For instance, Leidos
  (through LAISI) runs the FAA's Flight Service
  program, providing pilots and aircrew v
